---
title: GoodsReceipt State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending : Warehouse Keeper creates goods receipt (idempotent)
    Pending --> Received : Admin approves — creates batches, raises on-hand stock
    Pending --> Rejected : Admin rejects (rejection reason recorded, no stock change)
    Received --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
